 "geometry_notes": [
  "Every dimension read from each cell's 'SECTION B-B (Showing dimensions)'. Full width W at and below the key; the top band is inset 5/8 in each side (top width W - 1 1/4 in).",
  "Key: top band height t, then a 3/8 in high 45-degree-ish transition in to 1 1/4 in inset, vertical key face, then a 3/4 in high transition back out to full width at the top of the lower band; the key band height k includes both transitions.",
  "Bands (top/key/bottom): 11 in: 3/4/4; 17 in: 3/4 1/2/9 1/2; 21 in: 3/4 1/2/13 1/2; 27 in: 6/7/14; 33 in: 6/7/20; 42 in: 6/7/29.",
  "Voids: 5 1/2 in top and bottom slabs, 2 x 2 in void chamfers; webs 7 in (17x36, 21x36), 8 in (17x48, 21x48), 6 in (27-42 in deep), measured from the full-width face. 11 in beams are solid.",
  "1 1/2 x 1 1/2 in soffit chamfers; top corners square.",
  "Validation: the only published property row located (Design Guide 3.5 example, 27x36) is reproduced to A 569.92 vs 569.9 in2, I 49696.9 vs 49697 in4, Cb 13.295 vs 13.30 in. The BM Table 3.5.4-1 with the other rows is in the IDOT Bridge Manual, which was not retrievable (served via PowerDMS)."
 ],
